# Input

```svelte
{#each todos as todo (todo.id)}{todo}{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-{#each todos as todo (todo.id)}{todo}{/each}
+{#each todos as todo (todo.id)}
+    {todo}
+{/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each todos as todo (todo.id)}
    {todo}
{/each}
```
